==Strategy==
Ritual Cat has 350 range and high damage, so don't bring [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris]] nor the [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Leg]] variants. Instead, use cats with longer range and, if possible, Area Attack. This includes [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|dual]] [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dragons]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Wolf]] and most [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]].

